<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - ECI Telecom cut on price.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - ECI Telecom cut on price.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>SoundView Financial Group said analyst Chandan Sarkar lowered ECI Telecom Ltd to short-term hold from buy due to the stock's price.</p>
<p>-- maintained long-term buy on the shares.</p>
<p>-- said company's fundamental's &quot;still look good&quot; but shares had met his price target.</p>
<p>-- stock was off 1-1/2 to 30.</p>
</text>
